| Install the Tiberian Dawn game data into this application from a C&C95
| (C&C Gold) freeware CD image. Run it once for each disc:
|   *Obey <path>.!VanillaTD.Prepare <CD image> [-nomovies] [-force]
| -nomovies leaves out the movies (about 430 MB per disc).
| -force rewrites files that are already present.
Set VanillaConquer$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad <VanillaConquer$Dir>.Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Vanilla Conquer needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
WimpSlot -min 1024K -max 1024K
Run <VanillaConquer$Dir>.Utils.vcprep %*0 <VanillaConquer$Dir>
